cyrb53 (https://github.com/bryc/code/blob/master/jshash/experimental/cyrb53.js)

hashKey (src/message.ts, built into dist) implements bryc's cyrb53 string hash,
with seed 0, reduced mod 36^7. The upstream header reads:

    cyrb53 (c) 2018 bryc (github.com/bryc)
    License: Public domain (or MIT if needed). Attribution appreciated.
    A fast and simple 53-bit string hash function with decent collision resistance.
    Largely inspired by MurmurHash2/3, but with a focus on speed/simplicity.
